  m_text: 'Subscription Terms:

    VIP Subscription (Knife Hit) offers a weekly
    subscription, you will have a 3-days FREE trial period, after this period you
    will be charged 90.000 ... After buying this subscription, you will unlock following
    features: +200% apples from daily gift, +200% experience from bosses and no ads.
    This is an Auto-renewable subscription. The payment is charged to your account
    after confirmation. The subscription is renewed unless you turn it off 24 hours
    before the period ends. Your account will be charged for renewal as well. For
    more information, check the links below: '
